    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051128.0246\n\nNEW YORK, Nov. 28 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua international news advisory -- Nov. 28\n\n\n\n\nThe following major international news stories from the North America region are scheduled to be covered or pursued by Xinhua News Agency on Monday.\n\n-- US President George W. Bush is expected to deliver remarks on Border Security and Immigration Reform on Monday afternoon.\n\n-- Canada's Parliament is to vote Monday evening on a motion of non-confidence against Liberal government.\n\n-- The United Nations Security Council is to discuss the situation in Burundi on Monday and is expected to extend the mandate of the UN peacekeeping mission in the country.",
